  "notes": "Bootstrap-3-era open-source finance app. Each category row has a small colored square swatch (category color), a full-width data bar in the Real amount column — red (#d9534f) with percentage when a budget is set and overspent, grey (#757272) raw amount when no budget — a +/- input group for planned budget, difference %, and a light-blue magnifier button linking to reports. Zebra-striped rows (#f9f9f9). Sidebar uses left-border rules for account lists, bank logos as square thumbnails, blue (#0d59d2) amounts, orange-red for negative balances, highlighted current account in light blue fill with white text. Content column is capped ~800px leaving empty right gutter."
